লাহ সব কিছুর প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'To whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth. And Allah, over all things, is Witness.', 'আসমান ও যমীনের রাজ্বত্ব যাঁর, আর সেই আল্লাহ সব কিছুর প্রত্যক্ষদর্শী।', 'To whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth. And Allah, over all things, is Witness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085009.mp3', now()),
  (85, 10, '', '[{"id":10953,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":10954,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":10955,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَتَنُوا۟","transliteration":"fatanū","translation_bn":"নির্যাতন করেছিল","root":"فتن","lemma":"فَتَنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10956,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10957,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"wal-mu''mināti","translation_bn":"ও মু''মিনাদের (উপর)","root":"امن","lemma":"مُّؤْمِنَٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10958,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10959,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":10960,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَتُوبُوا۟","transliteration":"yatūbū","translation_bn":"তওবা করে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":10961,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"falahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্যে (রয়েছে) তাই","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10962,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابُ","transliteration":"ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10963,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":10964,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের জন্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":10965,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابُ","transliteration":"ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":10966,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرِيقِ","transliteration":"l-ḥarīqi","translation_bn":"দহনের","root":"حرق","lemma":"حَرِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":10967,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna fatanū l-mu''minīna wal-mu''mināti thumma lam yatūbū falahum ʿadhābu jahannama walahum ʿadhābu l-ḥarīqi', 'যারা মু’মিন পুরুষ ও নারীদের প্রতি যুলম পীড়ন চালায় অতঃপর তাওবাহ করে না, তাদের জন্য আছে জাহান্নামের শাস্তি, আর আছে আগুনে দগ্ধ হওয়ার যন্ত্রণা।', 'Indeed, those who have tortured the believing men and believing women and then have not repented will have the punishment of Hell, and they will have the punishment of the Burning Fire.', 'যারা মু’মিন পুরুষ ও নারীদের প্রতি যুলম পীড়ন চালায় অতঃপর তাওবাহ করে না, তাদের জন্য আছে জাহান্নামের শাস্তি, আর আছে আগুনে দগ্ধ হওয়ার যন্ত্রণা।', 'Indeed, those who have tortured the believing men and believing women and then have not repented will have the punishment of Hell, and they will have the punishment of the Burning Fire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085010.mp3', now()),
  (85, 11, '', '[{"id":13024,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":13025,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":13026,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13027,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"এবং করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":13028,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎকর্ম","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13029,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13030,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٌۭ","transliteration":"jannātun","translation_bn":"জান্নাত","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13031,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হচ্ছে","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":13032,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":13033,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"তার নীচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":13034,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্ণাসমূহ","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13036,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"সেটাই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":13037,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَوْزُ","transliteration":"l-fawzu","translation_bn":"সাফল্য","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَوْز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13038,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَبِيرُ","transliteration":"l-kabīru","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":13039,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti lahum jannātun tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru dhālika l-fawzu l-kabīru', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে তাদের জন্য আছে জান্নাত, যার পাদদেশ দিয়ে বয়ে চলেছে নির্ঝরিণী, এটা বিরাট সাফল্য।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds will have gardens beneath which rivers flow. That is the great attainment.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকাজ করে তাদের জন্য আছে জান্নাত, যার পাদদেশ দিয়ে বয়ে চলেছে নির্ঝরিণী, এটা বিরাট সাফল্য।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds will have gardens beneath which rivers flow. That is the great attainment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085011.mp3', now()),
  (85, 12, '', '[{"id":14282,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":14283,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَطْشَ","transliteration":"baṭsha","translation_bn":"পাকড়াও","root":"بطش","lemma":"بَطْش","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14284,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":14285,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَشَدِيدٌ","transliteration":"lashadīdun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই কঠিন","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":14286,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna baṭsha rabbika lashadīdun', 'তোমার প্রতিপালকের পাকড়াও অবশ্যই বড় কঠিন।', 'Indeed, the vengeance of your Lord is severe.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালকের পাকড়াও অবশ্যই বড় কঠিন।', 'Indeed, the vengeance of your Lord is severe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/085012.mp3', now()),
